#: ef84e43f6e744c26b0b2ba384cc12c5a of pybroker.scope.run_with_scope:3
msgid ""
":class:`StaticScope` is a per-process singleton, so a worker process "
"starts with an empty one and would not see the caller's registered "
"indicators, model sources, params or custom columns. Wrap work dispatched"
" to ``pybroker.parallel.parallel()`` in this to ship the caller's scope "
"along with it. Running sequentially, ``scope`` is already the installed "
"instance and this is a no-op."
msgstr ""

